# Optional "Translate & Dub" feature. Installed into a SEPARATE venv (.venv-dub): the voice model
# and its libraries (transformers, librosa) are kept apart from the main app's.
# Install:  setup_dub.bat (installs requirements-dub.txt, the lock with hashes made from this file;
# the command that makes it is at the top of requirements-dub.txt).
#
# voxcpm itself is installed with --no-deps (requirements-dub-voxcpm.txt): its own list pulls in the
# demo and training stack (gradio, modelscope, datasets, funasr); the runtime deps it needs are
# listed here explicitly.
# torch as in the main app (2.10+: PYSEC-2026-2286, the torch.load weights_only bypass)
